 "summary": "WorldMap with fit, fill and legs: the frame fitted to the hub and its five destinations at whatever size the window has (the geography around it fills the rest), each leg its own great-circle arc labelled with its distance, the text scaling with the map and labels placed apart from each other and from the city names.",
